List of Bond Yield-Related ICE BofA Indices Available on FRED
The Federal Reserve Economic Data (FRED) platform provides a variety of ICE BofA (formerly Bank of America Merrill Lynch) bond indices focused on yields, effective yields, semi-annual yields to worst, and option-adjusted spreads (OAS). These are downloadable in formats like CSV, Excel, or JSON directly from their series pages. Below is a comprehensive list compiled from FRED's search results for ICE BofA yield-related series. All data is daily and not seasonally adjusted, typically starting from the mid-1990s.
I've organized them into a table for clarity, grouped loosely by category (e.g., US High Yield, US Corporate, Emerging Markets). Note that some descriptions mention subsets of broader indices, and OAS measures the spread over Treasuries. For full details or downloads, search the series ID on fred.stlouisfed.org.
Series ID	Title	Description
US High Yield		
BAMLH0A0HYM2	ICE BofA US High Yield Index Option-Adjusted Spread	Spreads between a computed index of all bonds below investment grade and a spot Treasury curve.
BAMLH0A0HYM2EY	ICE BofA US High Yield Index Effective Yield	Effective yield of the index tracking US dollar denominated below investment grade corporate debt.
BAMLH0A0HYM2SYTW	ICE BofA US High Yield Index Semi-Annual Yield to Worst	Semi-annual yield to worst for below investment grade US corporate debt.
BAMLH0A3HYC	ICE BofA CCC & Lower US High Yield Index Option-Adjusted Spread	OAS for bonds rated CCC or lower.
BAMLH0A3HYCEY	ICE BofA CCC & Lower US High Yield Index Effective Yield	Effective yield for CCC-rated or lower US high yield bonds.
BAMLH0A3HYCSYTW	ICE BofA CCC & Lower US High Yield Index Semi-Annual Yield to Worst	Semi-annual yield to worst for CCC-rated or lower bonds.
BAMLH0A1HYBB	ICE BofA BB US High Yield Index Option-Adjusted Spread	OAS for BB-rated US high yield bonds.
BAMLH0A1HYBBEY	ICE BofA BB US High Yield Index Effective Yield	Effective yield for BB-rated US high yield bonds.
BAMLH0A1HYBBSYTW	ICE BofA BB US High Yield Index Semi-Annual Yield to Worst	Semi-annual yield to worst for BB-rated bonds.
BAMLH0A2HYB	ICE BofA Single-B US High Yield Index Option-Adjusted Spread	OAS for B-rated US high yield bonds.
BAMLH0A2HYBEY	ICE BofA Single-B US High Yield Index Effective Yield	Effective yield for B-rated US high yield bonds.
Euro High Yield		
BAMLHE00EHYIOAS	ICE BofA Euro High Yield Index Option-Adjusted Spread	OAS for Euro-denominated high yield bonds.
BAMLHE00EHYIEY	ICE BofA Euro High Yield Index Effective Yield	Effective yield for Euro high yield bonds.
BAMLHE00EHYISYTW	ICE BofA Euro High Yield Index Semi-Annual Yield to Worst	Semi-annual yield to worst for Euro high yield bonds.
US Corporate (Investment Grade)		
BAMLC0A0CMEY	ICE BofA US Corporate Index Effective Yield	Effective yield for investment-grade US corporate bonds.
BAMLC0A0CMSYTW	ICE BofA US Corporate Index Semi-Annual Yield to Worst	Semi-annual yield to worst for investment-grade US corporates.
BAMLC0A1CAAAEY	ICE BofA AAA US Corporate Index Effective Yield	Effective yield for AAA-rated US corporates.
BAMLC0A1CAAASYTW	ICE BofA AAA US Corporate Index Semi-Annual Yield to Worst	Semi-annual yield to worst for AAA-rated bonds.
BAMLC0A2CAAEY	ICE BofA AA US Corporate Index Effective Yield	Effective yield for AA-rated US corporates (inferred from similar series).
BAMLC0A2CAASYTW	ICE BofA AA US Corporate Index Semi-Annual Yield to Worst	Semi-annual yield to worst for AA-rated bonds.
BAMLC0A3CAEY	ICE BofA Single-A US Corporate Index Effective Yield	Effective yield for A-rated US corporates.
BAMLC0A3CASYTW	ICE BofA Single-A US Corporate Index Semi-Annual Yield to Worst	Semi-annual yield to worst for A-rated bonds.
BAMLC0A4CBBBEY	ICE BofA BBB US Corporate Index Effective Yield	Effective yield for BBB-rated US corporates.
BAMLC0A4CBBBSYTW	ICE BofA BBB US Corporate Index Semi-Annual Yield to Worst	Semi-annual yield to worst for BBB-rated bonds.
